Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.50,0:00:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《福尔摩斯历险记》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:25.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0008,,{\blur3}《最后一案》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.00,0:02:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}1891年春天 当我从一个短暂的休假\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I returned to Baker Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.22,0:02:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}回到贝克街的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from a short holiday in the spring of 1891,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.94,0:02:46.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我只见到过福尔摩斯没几次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had seen little of Holmes for some time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.03,0:03:02.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我从报纸上获悉 他受聘于法国政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw in the papers that he had been engaged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.36,0:03:05.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}承办一件极为重要的案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by the French government upon a matter of supreme importance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.39,0:03:08.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 出乎我预计的是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I could hardly foresee that it would have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这居然会产生如此可怕的后果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so violent a consequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.60,0:03:15.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在必须由我来告知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It lies with me now to tell for the first time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:19.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在那决定性的一年 发生在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}what took place between Mr. Sherlock Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.35,0:03:24.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯和莫里亚蒂教授之间的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Professor Moriarity in that fateful year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.15,0:03:29.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 哈德森太太 福尔摩斯先生回来了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,Mrs. Hudson has Mr. Holmes returned?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.15,0:03:30.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 他已经回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,he has indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.02,0:03:31.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他很早就来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He came in early.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.86,0:03:34.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}应该是7点之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have been before 7:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.04,0:03:36.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说 早啊 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Morning Mrs. Hudson" he says,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.13,0:03:38.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}给我准备了些什么美味的早餐没？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Have you anything nice for my breakfast?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.84,0:03:41.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像他四个月里根本没离开过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as if he hadn't been away for four months.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你本来可以让我大吃一惊的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You could have knocked me down with a feather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.68,0:03:47.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我猜他马上又出去了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he's gone out again I take it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.91,0:03:51.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 是的 他吃完早餐就又出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,yes he had his breakfast and then he went out again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.35,0:03:53.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就在他的拜访者离开后不久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just after his visitor left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.79,0:03:56.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}拜访者？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Visitor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.09,0:04:00.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一个上了年纪的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An elderly gentleman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.63,0:04:03.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们还吵了几句\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.03,0:04:07.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不喜欢那人的长相 一点都不喜欢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't like the look of him,not at all I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:11.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他的表情带着上帝的愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a face like,like the wrath of God{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.05,0:04:13.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更甚是恶魔的愤怒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or should I say the devil.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:15.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.37,0:04:19.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们是否应该开一瓶顶级红酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should we open a bottle of the best claret{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:22.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来庆祝福尔摩斯先生的回归？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to celebrate Mr. Holmes' return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.79,0:04:24.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么不呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:25.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.92,0:04:27.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你 哈德森太太\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you,Mrs. Hudson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.83,0:04:32.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我后来才知道 福尔摩斯先生在那天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I learned later that Holmes had survived three attempts{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.52,0:04:34.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经三次从试图取他性命的预谋中逃脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on his life that very day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但在我等待他回家之际时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But as I waited for him to reappear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.01,0:04:42.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我眼中的贝克街一如既往的平和安宁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Baker Street looked to me as safe and secure as ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:37.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.34,0:05:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等等 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait,wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.01,0:05:58.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.93,0:06:03.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}气枪 事实上 是一把非常特别的气枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air guns,a rather special air gun in fact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.56,0:06:08.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 你不反对把窗帘拉上吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson would you have any objection to drawing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.10,0:06:12.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随意点 装成好像只有你独自在这房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the blinds casually as if you were alone in this room?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.48,0:06:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想你对我是非常了解的 华生 你知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson I think you know me well enough to understand{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:40.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我并不是一个胆小怕事的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I am by no means a nervous man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.08,0:06:45.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可如果你危险临头还不承认有危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it is stupidity rather than courage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是有勇无谋了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to refuse to recognize danger when it is close upon you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.36,0:06:59.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}该死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.72,0:07:06.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生 能给我根火柴吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson,might I have a match?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.81,0:07:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯 你受伤了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes,you're hurt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.16,0:07:14.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}划伤而已 没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scratches,nothing,nothing to signify.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.34,0:07:23.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看起来不太好 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't look well Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:30.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}近来我把自己搞得过于精疲力尽了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well I have been using myself rather too freely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:33.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最近我有点儿吃紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have been somewhat pressed but late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.47,0:07:35.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}怎么了？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How pressed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.66,0:07:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然我在天黑前不可能离开这房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well as I am unable to leave this room until after dark{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.82,0:07:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也不可能走回我来的那条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then most likely on the way that I came,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.60,0:07:44.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们现在有足够的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we do have some time on our hands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.56,0:07:50.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}自从上次见面后 我还欠你一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Also I owe you an explanation for my unceremonious departure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.52,0:07:52.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不告而别的解释\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last time that we met.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.92,0:07:54.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想记些笔记 可以吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll take some notes if I may?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.93,0:07:57.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}哦 当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,by all means.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.12,0:07:58.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This case...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.00,0:08:03.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子 在犯罪年鉴上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This case,it is unique{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.18,0:08:05.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是很罕见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the annuals of crime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.66,0:08:12.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还记得我年初离开贝克街的时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will recall that it was a cold morning early in the year{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.86,0:08:14.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一个寒冷的早晨吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I last left Baker Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.04,0:08:20.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我对自己的去处和委托人身份毫不知情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had no idea where I was going or who my client was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所知道的就是 这非常重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All I knew was that it was important{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.24,0:08:23.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并且发生在国外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and abroad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.67,0:08:28.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我的目的地就是巴黎的卢浮宫和博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My destination was the museum and the Louve was in Paris{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:32.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我的委托人 正是法国政府\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and my client none less than the French government.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.66,0:08:45.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卢浮宫可以称得上是法国的心脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Surely this Louve is near to the very heart of France.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.18,0:08:49.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}伟大的法官就在这里开庭审理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was here that the great Musele held court{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:52.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也是拿破仑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and here that Napoleon Bonaparte{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.47,0:08:54.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和皇女\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was married to the Archduchess Madam{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.45,0:08:55.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}奥地利公主玛丽·路易丝结婚的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marie Louise of Austria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.01,0:09:00.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这里正是历史的纪念碑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed it is a history lesson in stone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.67,0:09:04.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 画廊拥有着世上最优秀的作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now this gallery contains our finest paintings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.40,0:09:08.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先生们 我们能不能直奔主题？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gentlemen,shall we come to the point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.22,0:09:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我推测蒙娜丽莎被偷了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I presume the Mona Lisa has been stolen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.24,0:09:20.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当我看到原来悬挂蒙娜丽莎的墙壁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I see two hooks and the place where{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:23.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}以及那两个挂钩 再加上这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Mona Lisa used to hang and then this talk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:26.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}八卦一类的谈话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of... and scandal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.58,0:09:33.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我终于有点明白这件事的谨慎之因了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,now I begin to understand the delicacy of the matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:41.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卢浮宫每周一都会闭馆整顿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Louve is closed on Mondays for maintenance.{\r}
