Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.01,0:15:32.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moriarity?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.17,0:16:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请注意这画对人物特征的精妙刻画\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Notice the subtle modeling of the features,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:03.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}美丽的双手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}beautiful hands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.74,0:16:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}安详的神情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}mood,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那微笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that smile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.31,0:16:11.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如同华特·培顿所形容的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As Walter Payton described her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.01,0:16:15.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}美颜在上 世界黯然失色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the head upon which all the ends of the world are common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.87,0:16:18.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}眼睑有一丝疲倦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The eyelids are a little weary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.37,0:16:19.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有人拥有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one else has ever had{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.62,0:16:23.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如此出神入化的绘画技巧 除了达·芬奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the genius to paint this masterpiece except De Vinci.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.96,0:16:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再来看看这幅画作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you look at the paint work sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.30,0:16:32.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}里奥纳多飘逸的签名 笔工精湛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leonard's signature at large,the brush work,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.86,0:16:35.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}收放自如 技巧娴熟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the bloom,the technique.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.62,0:16:39.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不好意思 失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.12,0:16:48.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以肯定地告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would say without hesitation that the general opinion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.01,0:16:51.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是艺术节公认的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the art world is that this{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.41,0:16:54.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}世上最伟大的肖像作品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is the greatest portrait ever painted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:21.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很遗憾地告诉你 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I very much regret to have to tell you sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.96,0:17:26.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这画我们不卖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that this painting is no longer for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.81,0:17:29.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不明白 教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand Professor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.14,0:17:31.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}难道是价格太低吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,the price maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.71,0:17:33.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以重新考虑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well now look,I'll reconsider.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.73,0:17:38.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会付你4百万 怎么样？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll give you a cool four million and how's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.59,0:17:40.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很抱歉 沃克先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry Mr. Walker,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.72,0:17:44.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这画现在是非卖品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the painting is no longer for sale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.72,0:17:49.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘿 你们这帮人在搞什么啊？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey,what you guys up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.57,0:17:52.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}把你的脏手拿开 你个混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take your hands off me you nick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.45,0:17:54.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}谢谢你们浪费时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks for nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.06,0:18:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那个该死的福尔摩斯已经找回原作了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That wretched Holmes has recovered the original.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.81,0:18:06.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些东西都是垃圾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are worthless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.36,0:18:08.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毁了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Destroy them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.24,0:18:10.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}烧掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}burn them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.13,0:18:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你亲自做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it yourself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要让任何人看见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and let no one else see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.82,0:18:19.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}遵命 莫里亚蒂教授\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,Professor Moriarity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.29,0:18:59.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恭喜你 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I must congratulate you,Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.68,0:19:02.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这等荣誉是你应得的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Such an honor and so well deserved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.22,0:19:03.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我其实也没做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There was no great problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.16,0:19:05.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这个案子基本上是自动解决的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The case practically solved itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:10.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我听说你今天早上有个拜访者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear you had a visitor this morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.56,0:19:11.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}噢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.55,0:19:15.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我回到贝克街\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had not been back in Baker Street{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.46,0:19:17.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}刚坐下不到半小时 就在这时…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}more than half an hour when...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.13,0:19:20.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不能上去 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you cannot go up there sir!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.25,0:19:47.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的前额\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have less frontal development{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.52,0:19:49.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不如我想象中那样发达\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than I should have expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.82,0:19:53.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}摆弄睡衣口袋里子弹上膛的手枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a dangerous habit,a finger loaded firearms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.50,0:19:55.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一个危险的习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the pocket of one's dressing gown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.77,0:20:22.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你显然不了解我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You evidentially don't know me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.96,0:20:25.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恰恰相反 我认为我对你十分了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On the contrary I think it's fairly evident that I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.76,0:20:31.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果有什么话要说 我可以给你5分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can spare you five minutes if you have anything to say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.53,0:20:37.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所要说的你都已经心知肚明了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All that I have to say has already crossed your mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.85,0:20:42.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而我的回答你也已经心知肚明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And possibly my answer has already crossed yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你决不让步？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stand fast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.37,0:20:45.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.97,0:21:01.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在法国一事上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You frustrated me in the affair{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.46,0:21:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你妨碍了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the French gold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:07.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}原来红头联盟的幕后黑手是你啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it was you behind the Red Headed League.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.93,0:21:11.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}真是一个极具创造性和挑战性的点子啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A very ingenious and welcome tried idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.79,0:21:15.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你抬举我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}High praise from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.14,0:21:21.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}1月4日你阻碍过我行事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You crossed my path first on the 4th of January.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.06,0:21:24.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}2月中旬你给我制造了很大麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the middle of February I was seriously inconvenienced{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.02,0:21:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而在3月底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by you and at the end of March{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.89,0:21:29.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你完全破坏了我的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was absolutely hampered in my plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.71,0:21:32.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你又妨碍了我在法国的最后一桩买卖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now with this last business in France you have placed me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.63,0:21:35.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你的不断阻挠 使我面临\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in such a position by your continual persecution{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.72,0:21:39.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}有丧失自由的危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I am in positive danger of losing my liberty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.43,0:21:47.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}事情已经是忍无可忍了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The situation is becoming an impossible one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.68,0:21:51.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你有什么打算吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you any suggestion to make?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.27,0:21:57.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须住手 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must drop it Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.44,0:22:00.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你知道 你真的必须住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really must you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:02.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我拒绝了呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what if I refuse?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.96,0:22:05.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我确信 一个如你般智慧的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm quite sure that a man of your intelligence{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.98,0:22:10.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以预见 这件事情只能有一个结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will see that there can be but one outcome to this affair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.53,0:22:13.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那就是你必须住手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is necessary that you should withdraw.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.55,0:22:15.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你把事情做绝了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have worked things in such a fashion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.53,0:22:18.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们只剩下这一种办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that we have only one resource left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.91,0:22:22.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到你把这件事搅成这个样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has been an intellectual treat to me to see{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.45,0:22:25.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这对我来说简直是智力上的一种乐事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the way in which you grappled with this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.06,0:22:30.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坦白说 如果我被迫采取任何极端措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I say unaffectedly that it would be a grief to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.06,0:22:34.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我来说 那是令人痛心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to be forced to take an extreme measure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.86,0:22:37.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你笑吧 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,you smile sir{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.61,0:22:42.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是我向你保证 那真是令人痛心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it really would I do assure you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.84,0:22:44.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}干我们这行危险是不可避免的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Danger is part of my trade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.07,0:22:48.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这不是危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是不可避免的毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is inevitable destruction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.18,0:22:53.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你所阻挠的不单是一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stand in the way not merely of an individual{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.93,0:22:56.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而是一个强大的组织 其雄厚力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but of a mighty organization,the full extent of which{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.43,0:22:59.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使是用尽你所有的智慧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}even you with all your cleverness have been{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.55,0:23:01.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}也无法完全了解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unable to realize.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.81,0:23:04.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你必须站开点 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must stand clear Mr. Holmes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.35,0:23:07.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}否则就会惹祸上身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or be trouble under foot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.59,0:23:10.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕由于我们谈得太起劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know I'm afraid that in the pleasure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.81,0:23:13.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会把别处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of this conversation I am neglecting business{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.31,0:23:17.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}等我去办的重要事情给耽搁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of importance which awaits me elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.66,0:23:26.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好吧 好吧 真遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,well,it seems a pity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.12,0:23:30.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是我已经仁至义尽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I've done what I could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.17,0:23:48.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这是你死我活的一场决斗 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a duel between you and me Mr. Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.65,0:23:53.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想把我置于被告席上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hope to place me in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.75,0:23:55.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想击败我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You hope to beat me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.64,0:24:00.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你的聪明足以使我遭到毁灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you are clever enough to bring destruction on me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.63,0:24:06.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}请放心好了 你会与我同归于尽的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}rest assured I shall do as much for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.56,0:24:18.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你过奖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have paid me several compliments,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.35,0:24:20.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Moriarity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.07,0:24:25.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}让我也来回敬你一句吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me pay you one in return when I say that if{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.34,0:24:29.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果能保证毁灭你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I were assured of the former eventuality{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.09,0:24:32.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为了社会的利益\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would,in the interests of the public,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:35.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}即使和你同归于尽 我也心甘情愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cheerfully accept the later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.12,0:24:42.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我答应与你同归于尽 但不是你毁灭我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can promise you the one but not the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.06,0:25:24.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他是犯罪界的拿破仑 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is the Napoleon of crime Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.50,0:25:26.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}几年来 我一直在努力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For years I have endeavored{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.31,0:25:28.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}抽丝剥茧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to break through the veil which shrouded him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.92,0:25:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}终于 我抓住了一条线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and at last I have seized a thread{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.86,0:25:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}跟着它找到了莫里亚蒂本人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and followed it to Moriarity himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.91,0:25:44.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 我已经撒好网等着将他绳之以法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now I'm ready to close on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:47.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果他没有先抓住你的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If he doesn't close upon you first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.52,0:26:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在下星期一 时机就成熟了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On Monday next,matters will be right{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.71,0:26:04.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}教授和他那一帮主要党羽\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the Professor and all the principal members{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.46,0:26:07.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}就要全部落入警察手中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of his gang will be in the hands of the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.36,0:26:14.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那时就会进行本世纪最大的刑事审判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then will come the greatest criminal trial of the century,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.33,0:26:16.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}40多起疑案即将破获\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the clearing up of over 40 mysteries{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.97,0:26:18.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他们将全部被判处绞刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the room full of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.52,0:26:25.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在逮捕前这几天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot do better than to get away{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.20,0:26:26.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我显然以离开此地为妙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the few remaining days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.66,0:26:28.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你愿意与我同去欧洲旅行一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would give me great pleasure Watson if you would come{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.54,0:26:29.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我就太高兴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}onto the continent with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.31,0:26:32.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去欧洲？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The continent?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.88,0:26:35.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我很高兴同你去 福尔摩斯 但是去哪？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be delighted Holmes,but where?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.38,0:26:36.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}随便那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anywhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.25,0:26:37.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}对我来说都一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's all the same to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.81,0:26:39.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 但是 我们难道不应该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,but won't we have to dispose of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.48,0:26:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}先处理完莫里亚蒂教授的事吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Professor Moriarity first?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.47,0:26:45.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经有人盯上这里了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems to me that we're under siege in this very room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.20,0:26:51.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这提醒我 我必须该上路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that reminds me I must be on my way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.16,0:26:53.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你不留一夜？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Won't you stay the night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.93,0:26:56.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 如果我留宿的话会给你造成危险的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,it's too dangerous for you if I stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.61,0:27:07.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会按原路返回并且回住处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will leave the way I came and find lodgings{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.52,0:27:09.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}找我的哥哥 迈克罗夫特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with my brother Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.19,0:27:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们明早动身\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We start tomorrow morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.65,0:27:11.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天早晨？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow morning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.28,0:27:14.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是的 一刻也不能耽搁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,yes,it is most necessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.20,0:27:18.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这些就是给你的指令 我请你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now here are your instructions and I beg of you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.46,0:27:19.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一定要不折不扣地遵照执行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to follow them to the letter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.99,0:27:22.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在我俩正在同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are now playing a double-handed game with me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:25.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}欧洲最有势力的犯罪集团\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watson against the most powerful syndicate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.13,0:27:27.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}作殊死的决斗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of criminals in Europe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.18,0:27:28.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不管你打算带什么样的行李\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will dispatch whatever luggage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.78,0:27:31.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要写地址 并于今夜派一个可靠的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you intend to take by a trusted messenger unaddressed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.28,0:27:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}送往维多利亚车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at the Victoria Station tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.02,0:27:36.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}明天一早 你叫哈德森太太雇辆高级马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In the morning you will send Mrs. Hudson for a handsome cab,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.96,0:27:40.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吩咐她不要雇第一辆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}desiring her not to take the first{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.98,0:27:43.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和第二辆主动来揽生意的马车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or second which may present itself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.15,0:27:49.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}用纸条写个地址交给车夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will drive to the Strand end of La Famules,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.49,0:27:51.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上面写着驶往劳瑟街斯特兰德尽头处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}handing the address to the cabman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.68,0:27:54.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}吩咐他不要丢掉纸条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but with a request that he will not throw it away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.02,0:28:17.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你要事先把车费付清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have your fare ready and the instant that your cab{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.77,0:28:22.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}马车一停 马上穿过街道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stops move speedily through the muse and time yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.98,0:28:26.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}于9:15到达街的另一端\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to reach the other end at exactly a quarter past 9:00{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.32,0:28:31.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你会见到一辆四轮轿式小马车等在街边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you will find a small broom waiting close to the curb{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.53,0:28:34.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}驾车的人的人披深黑色斗篷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}driven by a fellow with a heavy black coat,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.20,0:28:36.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}领子是红色镶边的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}tipped at the collar with red.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.70,0:28:39.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}上了车 便能及时赶到维多利亚车站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Into this you will stay and you will reach Victoria{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.87,0:28:42.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}搭乘开往欧洲大陆的快车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in time for the continental express.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.18,0:29:00.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}打扰 先生 你会说意大利语吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me sir,I wonder if you speak Italian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.19,0:29:00.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}很遗憾 我不会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,I'm afraid not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.03,0:29:03.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在找预定了这件隔间的先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm looking for the gentleman who reserved this compartment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.11,0:29:04.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}没有看到他 先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a sign of him sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.05,0:29:06.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果你要旅行 你最好快上车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you're traveling you better get aboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.29,0:29:52.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生 你还没有屈尊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dear Watson you haven't even condescended{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.62,0:29:54.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}向我道早安呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to say good morning to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.61,0:30:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪 福尔摩斯 你可把我吓着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good heavens Holmes,how you startled me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.68,0:30:08.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}严密防范依然是必要的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is still necessary to take every precaution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.94,0:30:32.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看来我做得很好 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did rather fine,Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.17,0:31:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}既然这是快车 而且又和轮船联运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see that this express runs in connection with the boat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.61,0:31:06.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们已经成功地把莫里亚蒂甩掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I think we've shaken off Moriarity very effectively.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.51,0:31:10.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他能怎么办呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well what will he do then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.28,0:31:11.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我能怎么办 他就能怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I should do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.68,0:31:14.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}定一辆专列\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engage a special train.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.07,0:31:16.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是那一定太晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he'll arrive too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.26,0:31:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看看火车时刻表就会知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll observe from your Bradshaw that this train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.90,0:31:22.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}这趟车要在坎特伯雷站停车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}stops at Canterbury and again at the boat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.37,0:31:24.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂会在码头上抓住我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moriarity will catch us there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.54,0:31:29.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}天哪 那别人还以为我们是罪犯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good heavens anybody would think that we were the criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.98,0:31:32.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们何不在他来到时先逮捕他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's arrest him as soon as he arrives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.20,0:31:35.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 那会前功尽弃的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,that would ruin everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.23,0:31:38.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如果我们先抓住了大鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we should catch the big fish then the smaller{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.25,0:31:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些小鱼就会横冲直撞 脱网而逃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would dart right and left out of the net.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.92,0:31:43.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 不 许多余党还未浮出水面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,no,and the rest is invisible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.57,0:31:46.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们该怎么办？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well what then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.47,0:31:51.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们要在坎特伯雷下车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall get ours at Canterbury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.52,0:32:12.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那我们的行李怎么办\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Holmes our luggage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.44,0:32:15.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们必须给莫里亚蒂留点线索\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must give Moriarity something to follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.67,0:32:17.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后呢？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What will we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.80,0:32:21.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们作横贯全国的旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We shall go across country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.58,0:32:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们到了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here we are Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.18,0:32:35.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}列车表从来不会让你失望的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bradshaw shouldn't let you down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.75,0:32:39.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在阿什福德中转站 我们可以搭1点的慢车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}From Ashford Junction we can take a 1:00 slow train{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.43,0:32:42.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到达哈斯汀 然后到达亲爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Hastings,then onto the dear old{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.66,0:32:45.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}老伦敦布莱顿和南海岸线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}London Brighton and South Coast line,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.28,0:32:49.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}驶过巴克斯山直达刘易斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bax Hill on to Lewis non-stop,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.13,0:32:50.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}之后到达纽黑文\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then onto New Haven,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.79,0:32:52.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}坐晚班船去维也纳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}evening boat to Vienna.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.05,0:32:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想我们可以提前吃午餐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think we've got time for an early lunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.22,0:33:03.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}太快了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.14,0:33:35.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你看 我们朋友的智力毕竟有限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are limits you see to even our friend's intelligence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.29,0:33:41.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在 华生 我们该给自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And now Watson,we shall treat ourselves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.97,0:33:45.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}买两个毡睡袋 以便鼓励下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a couple of carpet bags,encourage the manufacturers,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.41,0:33:48.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}沿途国家的睡袋商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the countries through which we travel and make our way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.22,0:33:51.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后从容自在地经过卢森堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}at leisure into Switzerland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.84,0:33:55.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}和巴塞尔 到瑞士一游\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}via Brussels,Luxemberg...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.57,0:34:00.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一切都如夏洛克·福尔摩斯所预料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It fell out as Sherlock Holmes had predicted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.42,0:34:02.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在布鲁塞尔住了两晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We stayed two nights in Brussels,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.51,0:34:06.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后悠闲地向东南方向继续旅行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then began to make our leisurely way southeast.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.26,0:34:08.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}度过了美妙的一周\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For a charming week{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.55,0:34:10.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们开始向阿尔卑斯山进发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we progressed towards the Alps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.91,0:34:39.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你如何看待？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.93,0:34:43.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}山石坠落是常有的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A common enough occurrence in the mountains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.41,0:35:22.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 没有比在酒的生产地品酒更惬意的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah,nothing like drinking the wine where it's grown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.67,0:35:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.50,0:35:38.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}所有党羽都已抓获 只有莫里亚蒂逃脱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All gang safely secured,only Moriarity escaped the net,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.50,0:35:39.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}迈克罗夫特写来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}signed Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.43,0:35:43.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他溜走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's given them the slip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.60,0:35:50.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我想最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think it would be better if you were to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.17,0:35:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你还是回英国去 华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}return to England Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.52,0:35:55.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}为什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.08,0:35:58.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}现在你和我作伴已经很危险了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will find me a very dangerous companion now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.87,0:36:05.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}莫里亚蒂会竭尽全力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Moriarity will devote all his energies to taking his{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.18,0:36:08.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}报复我 而如果我有个同伴…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}revenge upon me and if I have a companion...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.28,0:36:09.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你想甩我？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you be rid of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.26,0:36:14.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 但这次是迫不得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,except for the reasons I've given.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.78,0:36:18.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们已经经历过许多磨难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been in tight places before together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.68,0:36:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但没有一个像这次这样艰难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never as tight as this one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.39,0:36:25.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我不会离开你 的 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not leaving you Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.62,0:36:28.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}除非你命令我离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not unless you order me to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.65,0:36:41.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我以前从没来过瑞士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never been to Switzerland before{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.25,0:36:44.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是这些美景使我不由自主地想起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the beauty of the landscape reminded me irresistibly{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.27,0:36:47.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那些印度西北边境的省区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of the northwest frontier provinces of India.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.09,0:36:52.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}但是 尽管周围的景色如此优美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But in spite of the lovely scenery all around us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.30,0:36:54.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我心里非常清楚 夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was clear to me that never for one instant{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.90,0:36:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}心中的阴影\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}did Sherlock Holmes forget the shadow{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.09,0:36:58.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}一刻都没有消失过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that lay across him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.36,0:37:59.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我可以从他警惕的神情中看出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could tell by his sharp scrutiny of every face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.73,0:38:03.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他非常清楚 无论我们走到那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that he was well convinced that go where we would{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.07,0:38:05.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}危险都会一直尾随\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we would not be clear of the danger{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.36,0:38:08.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}绝不会消除\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was dogging our footsteps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.56,0:38:56.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是什么？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.37,0:39:21.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看见什么了吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.04,0:39:23.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不 什么都没\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.23,0:39:26.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是时候继续上路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time we went on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.04,0:39:29.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}汉斯 我们上路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hans,we're on our way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.20,0:39:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后我们到达了博那斯小镇的心脏地带\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At last we reached the heart of the burnice overland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.40,0:39:49.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}来到了迈林根的一个小村镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and came to the village of Mirengland{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.59,0:39:52.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我们在"大英旅馆"下榻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where we put up at the Englisher Hall{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.27,0:39:55.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旅馆的主人是老彼得·斯太勒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then kept by Peter Steiler the Elder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.15,0:40:11.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 斯太勒？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,Steiler?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.09,0:41:29.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}翻山到达罗森洛依 一路上的风景迷人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The walk over to the hills to Rosenlawry is very beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.45,0:41:33.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你们可以在那过夜 第二天再回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can stay the night there and come back the next day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.58,0:41:37.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不要错过莱辛巴赫瀑布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you must not on any account miss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.26,0:41:42.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可以稍微绕一些路去欣赏一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the falls of Reichenbach which is only a small detour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.06,0:41:44.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊 就是那了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh,there it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.84,0:42:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那确实是一个险恶的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is indeed a fearful place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.11,0:42:24.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}融雪汇成激流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The torrent,swollen by the melting glacier,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.17,0:42:30.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}倾泻进万丈深渊 水花高溅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}plunges into a tremendous abyss in which the spray rose up{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.94,0:42:33.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}宛如房屋失火时冒出的浓烟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like the smoke from a burning house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.04,0:42:55.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herr,Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.74,0:43:00.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herr,Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.90,0:43:04.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}华生医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herr,Dr. Watson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.57,0:43:05.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}什么事？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.55,0:43:08.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯太勒先生让我把这个交给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Herr Steiler told me to give you this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.05,0:43:10.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}非常紧急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is very urgent.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.43,0:43:16.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}好像是一个英国妇女在我们离开以后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It seems an English woman was taken to the hotel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.07,0:43:19.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}被送到了旅馆 她正要去卢塞恩访友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}after we left on her way to friends in Lucerne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.20,0:43:20.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不料她突然咯血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's had a great hemorrhage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.15,0:43:22.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是肺结核\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tuberculoses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.92,0:43:24.17,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是肯定的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh,no doubt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.42,0:43:26.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她颇有生命危险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It appears she's dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.02,0:43:31.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}如有位英国医生为她诊治 她会十分欣慰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An English doctor would be a great consolation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.08,0:43:32.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}恐怕我必须回去了 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid I must go back Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.75,0:43:33.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那是当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.28,0:43:38.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}斯太勒还建议你让这个小伙子给你带路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steiler suggests that this lad shows you the way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.07,0:43:41.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}去罗森洛依 我稍后和你们会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to Rosenlawy and I'll join you there later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.09,0:43:42.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不错的计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A good plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.65,0:44:11.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}嘿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.18,0:44:59.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}她病情没有恶化吧？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust she's no worse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.99,0:45:01.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}？？？？？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}?????{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.28,0:45:12.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你没有写这封信吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't write this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.59,0:45:18.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}旅馆里没有一位生病的英国女人吗？\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no sick English woman at the hotel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.93,0:45:22.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}可是这上面有旅馆的印章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No,but it has the hotel mark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.72,0:45:26.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}当然 这一定是那高个子英国人写的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course,there was a tall old Englishman{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.88,0:45:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他在你们走之后过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who came here after you had gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.97,0:45:29.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.19,0:46:46.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}看到登山杖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the sight of the Alpine stalk{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.31,0:46:49.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}不由使我不寒而栗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that turned me cold and sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.54,0:46:52.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他并没有去罗森洛依\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had not gone to Rosenlawy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.61,0:46:57.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我在那站了一两分钟 平复自己的心情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I stood for a minute or two to collect myself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.25,0:47:01.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}因为我被这件事吓昏了头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for I was dazed with the horror of the thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.84,0:47:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}然后开始想起福尔摩斯的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then I began to think of Holmes' own methods{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.85,0:47:10.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}竭力运用它去查明这场悲剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to try to practice them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.04,0:47:16.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.46,0:47:22.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.19,0:47:27.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.94,0:48:05.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我亲爱的华生 承蒙莫里亚蒂先生的好意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My Dear Watson,I write these few lines{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.63,0:48:07.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我写下这几行书信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}through the courtesy of Mr. Moriarity{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.09,0:48:10.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}他正等着对我们之间存在的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who awaits my convenience for the final discussion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.84,0:48:13.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}进行最后的讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of those questions which lie between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.14,0:48:15.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我一想到我能为社会除掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm pleased to think that I shall be able{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.95,0:48:19.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}由于他的存在而带来的祸害 就很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to free society from any further affects of his presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.50,0:48:23.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}虽然 这恐怕要以给我的朋友们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Though I fear that it is at a cost{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.41,0:48:25.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带来痛苦为代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which will give pain to my friends{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.44,0:48:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}尤其是给你 我亲爱的华生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and especially my dear Watson,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.61,0:48:32.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}带来悲哀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.25,0:48:38.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}正如你所知 我的生涯已经\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As you know,my career had in any case{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.36,0:48:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}到了紧要关头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reached a crisis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.51,0:48:43.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}而对我而言 没有比这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And no possible conclusion to it could be more congenial{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.57,0:48:45.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}更令我心满意足的结局了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to me than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.55,0:48:49.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}诚然 如果我对你彻底坦白说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Indeed if I may make a full confession to you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.31,0:48:52.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我早就知道那封信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was convinced that the letter...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.95,0:48:54.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}是一场骗局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was a hoax.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.83,0:48:58.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}在离开英国时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made every disposition of my property{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.06,0:48:59.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我已将薄产作了处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before leaving England{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.62,0:49:02.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}并已付与我兄迈克罗夫特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and handed it to my brother Mycroft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.81,0:49:05.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}再见 好运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good bye and good luck{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.36,0:49:08.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你是我最亲爱的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and believe me to be my dear fellow,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.48,0:49:12.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}你忠诚的夏洛克 福尔摩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}very sincerely yours,Sherlock Holmes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.14,0:49:25.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}毫无疑问 在这种情况下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this situation I have little doubt{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:25.99,0:49:28.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}那两人之间的斗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that a personal contest between the two men{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.60,0:49:32.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}已经结束 因为它已无法继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ended as it could hardly fail to end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.73,0:49:34.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ahh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.88,0:51:31.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我怀着无比沉重的心情提起笔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's with a heavy heart that I take up my pen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.27,0:51:36.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最后写下我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to write these last words in which I shall ever record{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.81,0:51:40.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}福尔摩斯先生所拥有的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}singular gifts by which my friend{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.76,0:51:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}卓越才能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Sherlock Holmes was distinguished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:46.77,0:51:48.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我会永远把他视为\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shall ever regard him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.69,0:51:52.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}我所知道的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as the best and wisest man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.33,0:51:53.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}最优秀 最睿智的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have ever known.{\r}
